*> vybe-test: cobol/level_77/test_level_77_display_usage_and_redefines
*> origin: languages/cobol/tests/cobol/test_level_77.rs

IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. T.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-VYBE-L PIC X(256).
77 WS-NUM PIC 9(5) USAGE COMP.
77 WS-ALPHA PIC X(3) VALUE "ABC".
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    MOVE 12 TO WS-NUM.
    DISPLAY WS-ALPHA.
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-VYBE-L
    STRING WS-ALPHA DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-VYBE-L
    IF WS-VYBE-L NOT = "ABC"
        DISPLAY "FAIL: want [ABC] got [" WS-VYBE-L "]"
        MOVE 1 TO RETURN-CODE
        RAISE EXCEPTION EC-PROGRAM
    END-IF.
    DISPLAY WS-NUM.
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-VYBE-L
    STRING WS-NUM DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-VYBE-L
    IF WS-VYBE-L NOT = "00012"
        DISPLAY "FAIL: want [00012] got [" WS-VYBE-L "]"
        MOVE 1 TO RETURN-CODE
        RAISE EXCEPTION EC-PROGRAM
    END-IF.
    STOP RUN.

